Yaesu FT-710.</p><p><strong>FreeRig710:</strong> ESP32-P4 radio control, live video, browser audio and integrated FT8.</p><p><strong>Unified audio/PTT:</strong> the production GUI uses <code>/api/v1/audio/ws</code> for RX PCM, browser microphone PCM and latching PTT with a 1.5 s safety watchdog.</p><p><img class="video" src="/video.mjpeg" alt="Live HDMI video"></p><ul><li><a href="/video.mjpeg">/video.mjpeg</a> (live MJPEG)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/audio">/api/v1/hardware/audio</a> (RX + TX UAC1 status)</li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/cat">/api/v1/hardware/cat</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/radio/state">/api/v1/radio/state</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/hardware/usb">/api/v1/hardware/usb</a></li><li><a href="/api/v1/health">/api/v1/health</a></li></ul></body></html>␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀,t@1␀␀␀␀␀␀␀(t@2␀␀␀␀␀␀␀<t@3␀␀␀␀␀␀␀ШЉ@4␀␀␀␀␀␀Ш@5␀␀␀␀␀␀\t@6␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Dt@7␀␀␀␀␀␀␀шЖ@8␀␀␀␀␀␀␀dt@9␀␀␀␀␀␀␀¤u@A␀␀␀␀␀␀Tt@B␀␀␀␀␀␀ёt@C␀␀␀␀␀␀␀Lt@D␀␀␀␀␀␀8®@E␀␀␀␀␀␀␀u@F␀␀␀␀␀␀Ё€@␀З@З@З@З@ З@8Ђ@(З@0З@8З@Њ€@@З@HЗ@0Ђ@PЗ@XЗ@$Ђ@0␀␀␀`З@1␀␀␀lЗ@2␀␀␀xЗ@3␀␀␀ђЗ@4␀␀␀ЁЗ@6␀␀␀АЗ@7␀␀␀ШЗ@9␀␀␀рЗ@A␀␀␀␀H␀И@А3␀O␀И@@w␀Ђ„␀И@аg5␀␀	=␀ И@ 5M␀)S␀$И@АПj␀ co␀(И@ љ␀pаљ␀,И@ЂџХ␀°цЪ␀0И@ ІА84И@@o@MG8И@ђК{0Q}<И@␀?« /Е@И@ЂръЂщ7DИ@Ђ,А_;HИ@0123456789ABCDEF␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀␀p—@␀␀аяяяпA␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀pЗ@␀␀␀␀␀␀™@␀␀␀␀␀␀T@␀␀␀␀␀ќМ@␀␀␀␀␀И™@␀␀␀␀␀␀рї␀␀␀␀␀␀р?␀␀␀␀␀zЎ@␀␀␀␀␀␀@␀␀␀␀␀␀@333333у?љ™™™™™Щ?␀␀␀␀␀pз@␀␀␀␀␀LН@␀␀␀␀␀␀4@љ™™™™™й?␀␀␀␀␀@Џ@␀␀␀␀␀␀°<␀␀АяяяЯA␀␀␀␀␀␀аБяяяяяяп␀␀␀␀␀␀ш␀␀␀␀␀␀рНМММММММ␀␀␀␀␀аБб=UUUUХ?ЏВu=␀␀ В␀␀ЂїЧЈp?␀@F␀␀ AНМL>␀␀␀В␀␀ A␀юяF␀␀zD␀␀Ђ␀␀Ђ?␀Єё?pҐм6␀␀Ђ>␀␀␀?;Єё?␀␀ЂKBсS>U2l>Ј‹>«ЄЄ>·mЫ>љ™?␀␀@@␀@v?O8v?Ж#цё<Є83␀r1?r1?Њѕї5L»13кЭ5UіЉ8a6;«Є*>␀␀␀@␀␀␀L␀␀␀3␀␀ЂЂ␀␀Ђ␀яяяяяjpeg_del_encoder_engine␀s_cfg_desc␀␀s_jpeg_set_header_info␀␀jpeg_ll_sample_mode_select␀␀s_jpeg_enc_transaction_on_job_picked␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_encoder_process␀␀␀␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_new_encoder_engine␀jpeg_check_intr_priority␀␀␀␀jpeg_acqu